  "provenance": "simulated; substituted description worker only, no hardware",
  "what_this_is": "One capture per enumeration scenario -- the result of a 'Refresh devices' action. Enumerating opens nothing: on macOS every transport is read out of the IORegistry (usbio_ox.c:34-98, hidio.c:288-297, icoms_ux.c). Each unit carries what a picker must show, including units it must NOT open silently. Each unit's `opening_requires` is the argument describe needs first: null when it needs none, `expect` for an unidentified path, or not_permitted when nothing opens it. `opening` repeats it per index."
